mplement and validate user-centric designs. Develop scalable backend services using Java 21 Design and implement REST APIs consumed by frontend applications. Troubleshoot and resolve production issues. Translate high-level architectural designs into technical implementations. Create and maintain detailed technical and design documentation. Skills Must have Experience Required 5+ years of software development experience. Strong experience in Java enterprise application development. Experience building enterprise-scale web applications. Experience developing REST APIs and backend services. Experience working within Agile/Scrum product teams. Experience with automated testing and CI/CD environments. Tech Requirements Java 21 RESTful Services Linux JavaScript/TypeScript/Angular REST API integration Responsive web development Software Engineering Git CI/CD Pipelines Agile/Scrum SAFe methodology Software Design Patterns Unit and Integration Testing API Design Technical Documentation Nice to have RxJava Vert.X SAP UI5 SAP Fiori Other Languages: English: B2 Upper Intermediate Seniority: Senior \n Location - pune,mumbai,chennai,Bengaluru\n\nKey Skills: Requirements,Angular,Integration,Architecture,Enterprise,Development,Continuous Integration,Application","role_search":"Backend Developer"},{"title":"PSU \\ Govermment  Sales (IT Infrastructure)","company":"Rajesh Kumar","location":"Mumbai","source":"foundit","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/psu-govermment-sales-it-infrastructure-rajesh-kumar-proprietor-of-aayam-consultants-delhi-69860977","date_posted":"2026-11-20","experience":"6-15 Years","is_walkin":false,"role_search":"Software Developer"},{"title":"Software Engineer III - Data analytics, Databricks","company":"JP Morgan Services India Pvt Ltd","location":"Mumbai","source":"apna","url":"https://apna.co/job/1183332182","date_posted":"2026-11-20","experience":"Min. 3 years","is_walkin":false,"role_search":"Data Engineer"},{"title":"Lead Software Engineer- React, AWS, Java"