developer-moneymul-technologies-pvt-ltd-noida-delhi-ncr-2-to-6-years-031126019226","date_posted":"2026-11-20","experience":"2-6 Yrs","skills":[3,4,12,13,14,15,16,17,19,20,21,24,30,104,116],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Job Description \n Senior Backend / Full Stack Engineer Node.js (with React.js) \n Backend-focused (~70%) with React.js frontend (~30%) TypeScript \n Experience: 38 years\n Employment Type: Full-time\n Work Mode: Work From Office (WFO) only 9:30 AM to 6:30 PM, Monday to Friday\n Location: Client location, Sector 62, Noida\n Reports To: Engineering Lead\n Role Overview \nWe are looking for a hands-on Senior Backend Engineer (with full-stack ability) who is a strong thinker and independent problem-solver. The role is backend-heavy roughly 70% backend in Node.js (TypeScript) and about 30% frontend in React.js (TypeScript). You will design APIs and data models, build integrations, and take real ownership: given just a feature idea even without a detailed BRD, PRD, or Figma design you should be able to do the R&D, define the requirements and approach yourself, and build it end to end. We want someone with an edge who takes initiative, fills in the gaps, digs into unknowns, and ships.\n Primary Focus Areas \n Backend (Node.js): (~70%) Design and build backend services and APIs in Node.js with TypeScript (Express/NestJS) REST APIs, data modeling in PostgreSQL via an ORM, Redis caching, third-party integrations, and security.\n Frontend (React.js): (~30%) Build responsive front-ends in React.js (TypeScript) components, state management, hooks, and API integration; turn a Figma design (or just a rough idea) into working UI.\n Key Responsibilities \n Backend Development: Develop and maintain Node.js (TypeScript) services and REST APIs with clean, testable, well-structured code.\n Database & ORM: Design and optimize PostgreSQL schemas and work through an ORM (Sequelize or Prisma) migrations, relations, indexing, and transactions; write raw SQL when needed.\n¢ Integrations: Build integrations with third-party services and APIs (payments, auth providers, messaging, internal systems) reliably and securely.\n¢ Security & Auth: Own application security authentication/authorization with Keycloak (JWT/OAuth2/OIDC), input validation, secrets handling, and secure coding practices.\n¢ Observability & Tracing: Instrument services with observability and distributed tracing (OpenTelemetry with a tool like Jaeger / Grafana Tempo / SigNoz) to debug and monitor across services.\n¢ R&D & Ownership: Take ownership end to end: from just a feature idea without waiting for a detailed BRD, PRD, or Figma design do the R&D, define the requirements and approach yourself, and build/deliver it independently.\n¢ Frontend Development: Build React.js UIs (~30% of the role): reusable components, state management, hooks, and API integration from a Figma design or, when there isn't one, from the idea itself.\n¢ Caching & Performance: Use Redis for caching, sessions, or queues to improve performance and scalability.\n¢ Testing & Quality: Write unit and integration tests; participate in code reviews and maintain code quality.\n¢ Collaboration & Mentoring: Collaborate with product, design, and QA; guide and mentor ","role_search":"Frontend Developer"},{"title":"Vacancyne Hiring Vacancy","company":"Vacancyne","location":"Kochi","source":"google_images","url":"https://lookaside.instagram.com/seo/google_widget/crawler/?media_id=4033315938870262140","date_posted":"2026-11-20","experience":"Fresher / Experienced","salary":"Competitive / Best in Industry","is_walkin":true,"walkin_time":"","contact_email":"","contact_phone":"8592057099","flyer_image_url":"https://lookaside.instagram.com/seo/google_widget/crawler/?media_id=4033315938870262140","venue":""},{"title":"Get","company":"Mmplpvt.Ltd","location":"Kolkata","source":"google_images","url":"https://lookaside.instagram.com/seo/google_widget/crawler/?media_id=4033666050989578849","date_posted":"2026-11-20","ex